---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Now | Shlok Mehndiratta"
  description="What Shlok Mehndiratta is currently working on, reading, thinking about, and exploring right now."
>
  <div class="space-y-10 max-w-2xl">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>Living Status</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50">
        What I'm Doing Now
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
        Last updated: October 2026 • From IISER Bhopal Campus, India
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
      <!-- Section 1: Immediate Academic Objective -->
      <section class="space-y-3 p-5 rounded-xl border border-sky-500/20 bg-sky-500/5 dark:bg-sky-500/10">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-sky-900 dark:text-sky-200 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🎯 Graduate Admissions (Fall 2026/2027)</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300">
          I am actively preparing applications for <strong>MS and PhD programs in EECS / ECE / CS abroad</strong>. My goal is to join a rigorous research group focused on statistical signal processing, networked intelligence, or dynamical graph learning. If you are a prospective PI whose lab works on these topics, I'd love to connect.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Research Focus -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.06] pb-2">
          Research & Academic Focus
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
          <li>
            Completing my <strong>BS Thesis</strong> in EECS at IISER Bhopal, developing adaptive recursive estimators for dynamic time-varying graphs.
          </li>
          <li>
            Polishing a manuscript under review at IEEE Transactions regarding non-convex manifold regularization.
          </li>
          <li>
            Writing code benchmarks to stress-test decentralized consensus algorithms against adversarial packet losses.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Reading Stack -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.06] pb-2">
          On My Desk & Reading List
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
          <li class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Math</span>
            <span><em>Convex Optimization</em> — Stephen Boyd & Lieven Vandenberghe</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Signals</span>
            <span>Foundational papers on Graph Signal Processing (Shuman, Ortega, et al.)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Pleasure</span>
            <span><em>Surely You're Joking, Mr. Feynman!</em> — Richard Feynman</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Tools & Toys -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 border-b border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.06] pb-2">
          Tools & Experiments
        </h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">
          Playing with <strong>Julia</strong> for differential equation solving, writing custom plotting routines in Python, and configuring lightweight Neovim workflows for fast mathematical note-taking in LaTeX.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Footnote about /now movement -->
    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-black/[0.06] dark:border-white/[0.06] text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500">
      Inspired by Derek Sivers' <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-zinc-700 dark:hover:text-zinc-300">/now page movement</a>.
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
